{"seq":3,"slug":"hardware-abstraction","title":"硬件抽象层与 embedded-hal 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/hardware-abstraction","wordCount":632,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"硬件抽象层与-embedded-hal-设计\">硬件抽象层与 embedded-hal 设计</h1><p>嵌入式系统的核心挑战之一是硬件碎片化——每个芯片厂商的 GPIO、SPI、I2C、UART 接口都有不同的寄存器布局和操作方式。<code>embedded-hal</code> 通过 Rust 的 trait 系统定义了统一的硬件抽象接口，使得驱动代码可以跨芯片复用。2026 年，embedded-hal 1.0 已稳定发布，成为整个嵌入式 Rust 生态的契约基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>embedded-hal 的设计遵循分层解耦原则：芯片厂商实现 HAL trait（平台 HAL），设备驱动针对 trait 编程（平台无关驱动），应用层组合两者。这使得一个 BME280 温湿度传感器驱动可以同时在 STM32、nRF52 和 ESP32 上工作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[应用层] --&gt;|使用| B[设备驱动 e.g. bme280]&#10;    B --&gt;|依赖| C[embedded-hal traits]&#10;    D[embassy-stm32 HAL] --&gt;|实现| C&#10;    E[embassy-nrf HAL] --&gt;|实现| C&#10;    F[esp-hal] --&gt;|实现| C&#10;    G[embedded-hal-bus] --&gt;|共享总线| C&#10;    A --&gt;|选择平台| D&#10;    A --&gt;|或选择| E&#10;    A --&gt;|或选择| F\">graph TB\n    A[应用层] --&gt;|使用| B[设备驱动 e.g. bme280]\n    B --&gt;|依赖| C[embedded-hal traits]\n    D[embassy-stm32 HAL] --&gt;|实现| C\n    E[embassy-nrf HAL] --&gt;|实现| C\n    F[esp-hal] --&gt;|实现| C\n    G[embedded-hal-bus] --&gt;|共享总线| C\n    A --&gt;|选择平台| D\n    A --&gt;|或选择| E\n    A --&gt;|或选择| F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>trait 类别</th>\n<th>核心 trait</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>阻塞/异步</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数字 I/O</td>\n<td><code>InputPin</code>, <code>OutputPin</code>, <code>StatefulOutputPin</code></td>\n<td>GPIO 读写</td>\n<td>阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPI</td>\n<td><code>SpiDevice</code>, <code>SpiBus</code></td>\n<td>串行外设</td>\n<td>两者皆有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>I2C</td>\n<td><code>I2c</code></td>\n<td>总线通信</td>\n<td>两者皆有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UART</td>\n<td><code>Read</code>, <code>Write</code></td>\n<td>串口通信</td>\n<td>两者皆有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延时</td>\n<td><code>DelayNs</code></td>\n<td>精确延时</td>\n<td>阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PWM</td>\n<td><code>SetDutyCycle</code></td>\n<td>脉宽调制</td>\n<td>阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADC</td>\n<td><code>OneShot</code> (已废弃) → 各 HAL 自定义</td>\n<td>模拟采样</td>\n<td>平台相关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"编写平台无关的设备驱动\">编写平台无关的设备驱动</h2><p>embedded-hal 驱动只依赖 trait bound，不依赖任何具体硬件。这是泛型与 trait 在系统编程中最有力的应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use embedded_hal::i2c::I2c;&#10;&#10;const BME280_ADDR: u8 = 0x76;&#10;const REG_TEMP_MSB: u8 = 0xFA;&#10;const REG_CTRL_MEAS: u8 = 0xF4;&#10;&#10;pub struct Bme280&lt;I&gt; {&#10;    i2c: I,&#10;    addr: u8,&#10;    calibration: CalibrationData,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;I: I2c&gt; Bme280&lt;I&gt; {&#10;    pub fn new(i2c: I) -&gt; Result&lt;Self, I::Error&gt; {&#10;        let mut sensor = Self {&#10;            i2c,&#10;            addr: BME280_ADDR,&#10;            calibration: CalibrationData::default(),&#10;        };&#10;        sensor.read_calibration()?;&#10;        sensor.configure()?;&#10;        Ok(sensor)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn read_temperature(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Result&lt;f32, I::Error&gt; {&#10;        let mut buf = [0u8; 3];&#10;        self.i2c.write_read(self.addr, &amp;[REG_TEMP_MSB], &amp;mut buf)?;&#10;&#10;        let raw = ((buf[0] as i32) &lt;&lt; 12)&#10;                | ((buf[1] as i32) &lt;&lt; 4)&#10;                | ((buf[2] as i32) &gt;&gt; 4);&#10;&#10;        Ok(self.calibration.compensate_temperature(raw))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn configure(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Result&lt;(), I::Error&gt; {&#10;        // 温度过采样 x1, 气压过采样 x1, 正常模式&#10;        self.i2c.write(self.addr, &amp;[REG_CTRL_MEAS, 0b0010_0111])&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn read_calibration(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Result&lt;(), I::Error&gt; {&#10;        let mut cal_buf = [0u8; 26];&#10;        self.i2c.write_read(self.addr, &amp;[0x88], &amp;mut cal_buf)?;&#10;        self.calibration = CalibrationData::from_bytes(&amp;cal_buf);&#10;        Ok(())&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use embedded_hal::i2c::I2c;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const BME280_ADDR: u8 = 0x76;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const REG_TEMP_MSB: u8 = 0xFA;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const REG_CTRL_MEAS: u8 = 0xF4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct Bme280&#x3C;I> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i2c: I,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addr: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    calibration: CalibrationData,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;I: I2c> Bme280&#x3C;I> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(i2c: I) -> Result&#x3C;Self, I::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut sensor = Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            i2c,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            addr: BME280_ADDR,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            calibration: CalibrationData::default(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sensor.read_calibration()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sensor.configure()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(sensor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn read_temperature(&#x26;mut self) -> Result&#x3C;f32, I::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut buf = [0u8; 3];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.i2c.write_read(self.addr, &#x26;[REG_TEMP_MSB], &#x26;mut buf)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let raw = ((buf[0] as i32) &#x3C;&#x3C; 12)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                | ((buf[1] as i32) &#x3C;&#x3C; 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                | ((buf[2] as i32) >> 4);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(self.calibration.compensate_temperature(raw))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn configure(&#x26;mut self) -> Result&#x3C;(), I::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 温度过采样 x1, 气压过采样 x1, 正常模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.i2c.write(self.addr, &#x26;[REG_CTRL_MEAS, 0b0010_0111])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn read_calibration(&#x26;mut self) -> Result&#x3C;(), I::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut cal_buf = [0u8; 26];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.i2c.write_read(self.addr, &#x26;[0x88], &#x26;mut cal_buf)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.calibration = CalibrationData::from_bytes(&#x26;cal_buf);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个驱动可以在任何实现了 <code>I2c</code> trait 的平台上使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// STM32 上使用&#10;let i2c = embassy_stm32::i2c::I2c::new(p.I2C1, p.PB6, p.PB7, ...);&#10;let mut sensor = Bme280::new(i2c)?;&#10;&#10;// nRF52 上使用——相同的驱动代码&#10;let i2c = embassy_nrf::twim::Twim::new(p.TWISPI0, ...);&#10;let mut sensor = Bme280::new(i2c)?;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// STM32 上使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let i2c = embassy_stm32::i2c::I2c::new(p.I2C1, p.PB6, p.PB7, ...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut sensor = Bme280::new(i2c)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// nRF52 上使用——相同的驱动代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let i2c = embassy_nrf::twim::Twim::new(p.TWISPI0, ...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut sensor = Bme280::new(i2c)?;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总线共享与-embedded-hal-bus\">总线共享与 embedded-hal-bus</h2><p>多个设备共享同一条 SPI 或 I2C 总线是嵌入式中的常见场景。<code>embedded-hal-bus</code> crate 提供了安全的总线共享机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use embedded_hal_bus::spi::{ExclusiveDevice, NoDelay};&#10;use embassy_stm32::gpio::Output;&#10;use embassy_stm32::spi::Spi;&#10;&#10;// 一条 SPI 总线，两个设备各有独立 CS 引脚&#10;let spi_bus = Spi::new(p.SPI1, p.PA5, p.PA7, p.PA6, ...);&#10;&#10;// 使用 Mutex 包装总线，允许多任务共享&#10;use embassy_sync::mutex::Mutex;&#10;use embassy_sync::blocking_mutex::raw::NoopRawMutex;&#10;static SPI_BUS: StaticCell&lt;Mutex&lt;NoopRawMutex, Spi&gt;&gt; = StaticCell::new();&#10;let spi_bus = SPI_BUS.init(Mutex::new(spi_bus));&#10;&#10;// 设备 1: SD 卡&#10;let cs_sd = Output::new(p.PA4, Level::High, Speed::High);&#10;let sd_device = ExclusiveDevice::new(spi_bus, cs_sd, NoDelay);&#10;&#10;// 设备 2: 显示屏&#10;let cs_display = Output::new(p.PB0, Level::High, Speed::High);&#10;let display_device = ExclusiveDevice::new(spi_bus, cs_display, NoDelay);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use embedded_hal_bus::spi::{ExclusiveDevice, NoDelay};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_stm32::gpio::Output;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_stm32::spi::Spi;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一条 SPI 总线，两个设备各有独立 CS 引脚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let spi_bus = Spi::new(p.SPI1, p.PA5, p.PA7, p.PA6, ...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 Mutex 包装总线，允许多任务共享</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_sync::mutex::Mutex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use embassy_sync::blocking_mutex::raw::NoopRawMutex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static SPI_BUS: StaticCell&#x3C;Mutex&#x3C;NoopRawMutex, Spi>> = StaticCell::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let spi_bus = SPI_BUS.init(Mutex::new(spi_bus));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 设备 1: SD 卡</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let cs_sd = Output::new(p.PA4, Level::High, Speed::High);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let sd_device = ExclusiveDevice::new(spi_bus, cs_sd, NoDelay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 设备 2: 显示屏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let cs_display = Output::new(p.PB0, Level::High, Speed::High);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let display_device = ExclusiveDevice::new(spi_bus, cs_display, NoDelay);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"异步-embedded-hal\">异步 embedded-hal</h2><p>embedded-hal 1.0 同时定义了阻塞和异步版本的 trait。异步版本在 <code>embedded_hal_async</code> crate 中，与 Embassy 的异步 HAL 完美配合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use embedded_hal_async::i2c::I2c as AsyncI2c;&#10;&#10;pub struct Bme280Async&lt;I&gt; {&#10;    i2c: I,&#10;    addr: u8,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;I: AsyncI2c&gt; Bme280Async&lt;I&gt; {&#10;    pub async fn read_temperature(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Result&lt;f32, I::Error&gt; {&#10;        let mut buf = [0u8; 3];&#10;        self.i2c.write_read(self.addr, &amp;[REG_TEMP_MSB], &amp;mut buf).await?;&#10;&#10;        let raw = ((buf[0] as i32) &lt;&lt; 12)&#10;                | ((buf[1] as i32) &lt;&lt; 4)&#10;                | ((buf[2] as i32) &gt;&gt; 4);&#10;&#10;        Ok(compensate_temperature(raw))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use embedded_hal_async::i2c::I2c as AsyncI2c;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct Bme280Async&#x3C;I> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i2c: I,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addr: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;I: AsyncI2c> Bme280Async&#x3C;I> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub async fn read_temperature(&#x26;mut self) -> Result&#x3C;f32, I::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut buf = [0u8; 3];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.i2c.write_read(self.addr, &#x26;[REG_TEMP_MSB], &#x26;mut buf).await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let raw = ((buf[0] as i32) &#x3C;&#x3C; 12)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                | ((buf[1] as i32) &#x3C;&#x3C; 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                | ((buf[2] as i32) >> 4);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(compensate_temperature(raw))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>异步驱动的优势在于 I2C/SPI 传输期间可以让出 CPU——当底层使用 DMA 时，传感器读取几百微秒的传输时间可以被其他任务利用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"probe-rs-与-defmt-调试\">probe-rs 与 defmt 调试</h2><p>probe-rs 取代 OpenOCD 成为 2026 年嵌入式 Rust 的默认调试工具。配合 defmt（deferred formatting），日志格式化在宿主机而非目标板执行，Flash 中不存储格式字符串。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use defmt::*;&#10;&#10;#[embassy_executor::task]&#10;async fn sensor_task(mut sensor: Bme280Async&lt;impl AsyncI2c&gt;) {&#10;    loop {&#10;        match sensor.read_temperature().await {&#10;            Ok(temp) =&gt; info!(&quot;温度: {:.2}°C&quot;, temp),&#10;            Err(e) =&gt; error!(&quot;I2C 错误: {:?}&quot;, e),&#10;        }&#10;        Timer::after_secs(1).await;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use defmt::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[embassy_executor::task]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn sensor_task(mut sensor: Bme280Async&#x3C;impl AsyncI2c>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match sensor.read_temperature().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Ok(temp) => info!(\"温度: {:.2}°C\", temp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Err(e) => error!(\"I2C 错误: {:?}\", e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Timer::after_secs(1).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 一条命令完成: 编译 → 烧录 → RTT 日志输出&#10;cargo run --release&#10;# 输出: 0.001234 INFO  温度: 23.45°C\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 一条命令完成: 编译 → 烧录 → RTT 日志输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出: 0.001234 INFO  温度: 23.45°C</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>embedded-hal trait 实现驱动与平台解耦，一次编写跨芯片复用</li>\n<li>设备驱动只依赖 trait bound，不绑定具体 HAL 实现</li>\n<li>embedded-hal-bus 提供安全的总线共享（Mutex + ExclusiveDevice）</li>\n<li>异步 embedded-hal 配合 DMA 释放传输期间的 CPU 资源</li>\n<li>probe-rs + defmt 是 2026 年嵌入式调试的标准工具链</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章上一篇 <a href=\"embassy-async-embedded\">Embassy 异步嵌入式框架</a> 覆盖执行器和任务模型</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/embedded-and-nostd\">Rust 语言 - 嵌入式与 no_std</a> 覆盖语言层的 no_std 支持</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"硬件抽象层与 embedded-hal 设计","id":"硬件抽象层与-embedded-hal-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编写平台无关的设备驱动","id":"编写平台无关的设备驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"总线共享与 embedded-hal-bus","id":"总线共享与-embedded-hal-bus"},{"level":2,"text":"异步 embedded-hal","id":"异步-embedded-hal"},{"level":2,"text":"probe-rs 与 defmt 调试","id":"probe-rs-与-defmt-调试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Embassy 异步嵌入式框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/embassy-async-embedded"},"next":{"title":"无锁数据结构实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/lock-free-data-structures"}}